# Ascending AUT order in test specs

Inside each feature spec, `test()` / `guestTest()` blocks with `@AUT-*` tags must be ordered ascending:

1. `@AUT-E2E-*` (numeric ID ascending)
2. `@AUT-FV-*` (numeric ID ascending)

When adding a new AUT, insert it at the correct sorted position — never leave the file out of order.

```bash
node scripts/reorder-aut-ascending.mjs --check
node scripts/reorder-aut-ascending.mjs
```

Also enforced in `.agents/rules/testing.md` → **Ascending AUT order**.
